# Real face-recognition engine: 512-d ArcFace embeddings via the buffalo_l
# model pack. Without these the backend degrades to OpenCV Haar-cascade
# detection with no recognition at all.
#
# These are NOT optional in any environment that matters:
#   - the production image installs them (docker/backend.Dockerfile)
#   - CI's ai-tests job installs them and runs tests/test_ai_pipeline.py with
#     SENTINEL_REQUIRE_AI=1, so a missing engine fails the build rather than
#     silently skipping (B1)
#
# They are kept in a separate file only because the lightweight CI jobs and
# local API work do not need a ~300 MB model download.

-c requirements.txt
insightface
onnxruntime
